---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Ask about my work
description: Ask a question about Kristian Garza's work and get a short answer built from his real projects, case studies and publications.
permalink: /ask/
suggestedQuestions:
  - question: Have you built AI products for researchers?
    href: /work/
  - question: What have you done with knowledge graphs?
    href: /work/knowledge-graph-engine/
  - question: Which design systems have you worked on?
    href: /work/creating-a-design-system/
  - question: What have you published on metadata and LLMs?
    href: /publications/
  - question: What side projects have you built with AI?
    href: /tools/
---

<div class="flex w-full max-w-4xl flex-1 flex-col gap-6 p-4 md:p-12 xl:p-8">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <h1 class="text-accent font-mono text-2xl font-bold">Ask about my work</h1>
    <p class="text-secondary text-lg">Ask a question about my projects, roles or writing. A small Claude model picks the projects, case studies and papers that answer it, and they render here as the same cards you see on the rest of the site. It only knows what's published on this site.</p>
  </div>

  {%- if site.askEndpoint %}
  <form id="ask-form" class="flex flex-col gap-2" data-endpoint="{{ site.askEndpoint }}" hidden>
    <label for="ask-question" class="text-accent font-mono text-sm font-medium">Your question</label>
    <textarea id="ask-question" name="question" rows="2" maxlength="300" required class="bg-surface border-card text-primary w-full rounded-lg border-2 p-4 text-base font-medium" placeholder="Has Kristian built AI products for researchers?"></textarea>
    <button type="submit" class="before:rounded-lg before:absolute before:top-0 before:bottom-0 before:right-0 before:left-0 inline-flex gap-3 relative items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-lg text-base font-medium ring-offset-white disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:bg-neutral-100 disabled:text-neutral-500 disabled:shadow-none active:transform active:scale-[99%] active:transition-transform active:duration-75 active:ease-in-out hover:cursor-pointer w-fit hover:before:bg-special-state-hover-inverse bg-button-primary text-white shadow-button-primary-rest active:shadow-none h-10 px-3 min-w-9">Ask</button>
  </form>
  {%- endif %}

  <section class="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <h2 class="text-accent font-mono text-sm font-medium">Try asking</h2>
    <ul class="flex flex-col gap-1">
      {%- for s in suggestedQuestions %}
      <li><a href="{{ s.href }}" data-question="{{ s.question }}" class="text-accent text-base font-medium underline hover:no-underline">{{ s.question }}</a></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <div id="ask-answer" class="flex flex-col gap-6" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="false"></div>
</div>
{%- if site.askEndpoint %}
<script type="module" src="/assets/js/ask.js"></script>
{%- endif %}
